      "hints": [
        "The minimum observed frequency occurs when the source is moving directly away from the distant observer.",
        "For a receding source, use the Doppler expression with v + vₛ in the denominator."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "The observed frequency is smallest when the source moves directly away from the observer at its full speed of 12.0 m s⁻¹.",
        "For a receding source, fₒ = fₛv / (v + vₛ).",
        "fₒ = (951 × 330) / (330 + 12) = 917.6 Hz.",
        "To three significant figures, the minimum frequency is 918 Hz."
      ],
